-- Typechecks cleanly. The #EVAL refuses, with a reason over three lines, the
-- second of which holds only what `l4 run` prints for a refused #ASSERT on
-- the line after "Result:". The file holds no #ASSERT.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`not modelled` MEANS REFUSE "this case is not modelled:\nassertion refused:\nis how a refused #ASSERT is reported"

#EVAL `not modelled`
